+### Formulas
+*   **Smooth Union**:
+    $$ h = \text{clamp}(0.5 + 0.5 \cdot \frac{d_2 - d_1}{k}, 0.0, 1.0) $$
+    $$ \text{result} = \text{mix}(d_2, d_1, h) - k \cdot h \cdot (1.0 - h) $$
